field-help-project-settings-formatting-date = How printed dates are written: day-month-year (14-03-2026) or year-month-day (2026-03-14), as the title block's Creation and Saved cells print them.
field-help-project-settings-formatting-decimal-separator = Whether printed numbers use a point or a comma, such as 0.75 or 0,75: the lists print quantities with it, and the panel layout writes millimetres with it. Unset, the language decides.
field-help-project-settings-formatting-tag-case = Whether tags that differ only in case are different tags.
field-help-project-settings-process-tag-scheme = The pattern every process tag follows, a regular expression with named groups (area, kind, number); the checks report a process tag outside it.
field-help-project-settings-identifier-set = The set of code letters the tags use, such as EN 81346-2:2009; unset, the derivation profile's. The checks report a device whose letter does not match its kind in this set.
field-help-project-settings-ip-pairing = How interruption points of one name are paired: as a star or a chain.
field-help-project-settings-revision-label = How revisions are labelled: V1.0, 01 or A.
